{"id":"n4_u03_l2","unit_id":"n4_u03","instructional_level":"N4","title":"Casual words and near / far","goal":"Use casual answers and describe distance.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_un","v_uun","v_tabun","v_mochiron","v_yappari","v_chikai","v_tooi","v_iro"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Friends' words","body":["うん (yes), ううん (no), たぶん (probably), もちろん (of course), やっぱり (after all). Also ちかい (near), とおい (far), いろ (colour)."],"examples":[{"ja":"もちろん いく","reading":"mochiron iku","en":"Of course I will go."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n4u03_ty04","q_n4u03_ty05","q_n4u03_dc03","q_n4u03_tr01","q_n4u03_tr02","q_n4u03_tr03","q_n4u03_tr04","q_n4u03_tr05","q_n4u03_tr06","q_n4u03_tr07","q_n4u03_vm_un","q_n4u03_vm_uun","q_n4u03_vm_tabun","q_n4u03_vm_mochiron","q_n4u03_vm_yappari","q_n4u03_vm_chikai","q_n4u03_vm_tooi","q_n4u03_vm_iro"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n4u03_ty04","q_n4u03_ty05","q_n4u03_dc03","q_n4u03_tr01","q_n4u03_tr05"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n4_u03_l3","unit_id":"n4_u03","instructional_level":"N4","title":"Verbs at the shrine","goal":"Learn four verbs for a visit.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_ogamimasu","v_toorimasu","v_atsumarimasu","v_oboemasu"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Four verbs","body":["おがみます (pray to), とおります (pass along), あつまります (gather), おぼえます (remember)."],"examples":[{"ja":"かみさま に おがみます","reading":"kamisama ni ogamimasu","en":"I pray to the god."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n4u03_vb01","q_n4u03_vb02","q_n4u03_vb03","q_n4u03_vb04"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n4u03_vb01","q_n4u03_vb02","q_n4u03_vb03","q_n4u03_vb04"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n4_u03_l4","unit_id":"n4_u03","instructional_level":"N4","title":"The dictionary form","goal":"Make and recognise the dictionary form.","introduces":{"grammar":["g_dict_form"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Rules","body":["Group 2: drop ます, add る. Group 1: change the last sound of the ます-stem to the う-row (み → む, い → う, し → す, き → く, ぎ → ぐ). Irregular: する, くる."],"examples":[{"ja":"のみます → のむ","reading":"nomimasu → nomu","en":"drink (polite → plain)"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n4u03_df01","q_n4u03_df02","q_n4u03_df03","q_n4u03_df04","q_n4u03_df05","q_n4u03_df06","q_n4u03_df07","q_n4u03_df08","q_n4u03_trd1","q_n4u03_gd02","q_n4u03_gd03","q_n4u03_gd04","q_n4u03_gd05","q_n4u03_gd06"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n4u03_df01","q_n4u03_df02","q_n4u03_df03","q_n4u03_df05","q_n4u03_df08","q_n4u03_trd1","q_n4u03_gd02"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n4_u03_l5","unit_id":"n4_u03","instructional_level":"N4","title":"Casual plain style","goal":"Talk to a friend with plain forms.","introduces":{"grammar":["g_plain_casual"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Friends talk","body":["Plain forms replace ます / ません: いく, いかない. Add の for a question and answer with うん / ううん."],"examples":[{"ja":"ううん いかない","reading":"uun ikanai","en":"No, I will not go."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n4u03_trp1","q_n4u03_trp2","q_n4u03_pc03","q_n4u03_pc04","q_n4u03_pc05","q_n4u03_pc06","q_n4u03_pc07","q_n4u03_pc08","q_n4u03_pc09","q_n4u03_gl01","q_n4u03_gl02","q_n4u03_gl03","q_n4u03_gl04"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n4u03_trp1","q_n4u03_pc03","q_n4u03_pc04","q_n4u03_pc05","q_n4u03_pc06","q_n4u03_gl02"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
